<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Free Ozarks Trip Planner — Top 5 Stops, Best Times to Visit & Cabin Picks by Season | OzarkRoost</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Download your free Ozarks trip planner with top 5 stops, seasonal cabin picks, and the best times to visit the Arkansas Ozarks. Get the guide via email — no spam, just the info you need.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://ozarkroost.polsia.app/guides/trip-planner">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Free Ozarks Trip Planner">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Top 5 stops, seasonal cabin picks, and the best times to visit the Arkansas Ozarks. Get the guide via email free.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://pub-629428d185ca4960a0a73c850d32294b.r2.dev/generated-images/company_197924/1da12ea6-9762-4418-aec4-f0db946b2776.jpg">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://ozarkroost.polsia.app/guides/trip-planner">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;1,9..40,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/guides.css">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "Free Ozarks Trip Planner — Top 5 Stops, Best Times to Visit & Cabin Picks by Season",
    "description": "Download your free Ozarks trip planner with top 5 stops, seasonal cabin picks, and the best times to visit the Arkansas Ozarks.",
    "image": "https://pub-629428d185ca4960a0a73c850d32294b.r2.dev/generated-images/company_197924/1da12ea6-9762-4418-aec4-f0db946b2776.jpg",
    "url": "https://ozarkroost.polsia.app/guides/trip-planner",
    "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "OzarkRoost", "url": "https://ozarkroost.polsia.app" },
    "datePublished": "2026-06-29",
    "dateModified": "2026-06-29"
  }
  </script>
  <style>
    /* ===== TRIP PLANNER PAGE STYLES ===== */
    .tp-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: clamp(400px, 50vh, 560px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--pine-dark);
    }
    .tp-hero__img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center 40%;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    .tp-hero__overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(14,34,18,0.90) 0%, rgba(14,34,18,0.40) 50%, transparent 80%);
    }
    .tp-hero__content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: var(--max-w);
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px 56px;
    }
    .tp-hero__badge {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--amber);
      background: rgba(212,137,63,0.18);
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .tp-hero__content h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
      color: var(--cream);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      max-width: 700px;
    }
    .tp-hero__sub {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.72);
      max-width: 520px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    /* ===== EMAIL GATE ===== */
    .tp-gate {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(28,61,42,0.10);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 36px 32px;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .tp-gate__title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 22px;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .tp-gate__sub {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .tp-gate__form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .tp-gate__input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      background: var(--cream);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(28,61,42,0.12);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .tp-gate__input:focus {
      border-color: var(--amber);
    }
    .tp-gate__input::placeholder {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .tp-gate__error {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #c0392b;
      background: rgba(192,57,43,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(192,57,43,0.15);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .btn--amber {
      background: var(--amber);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 14px 24px;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .btn--amber:hover { background: var(--amber-dark); }
    .tp-gate__fine {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-align: center;
      opacity: 0.7;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* ===== PLANNER CONTENT ===== */
    .tp-body {
      max-width: var(--max-w);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .tp-section {
      padding: 48px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28,61,42,0.08);
    }
    .tp-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .tp-section h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 34px);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .tp-section p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    /* ===== TOP STOPS GRID ===== */
    .tp-stops {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .tp-stop {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(28,61,42,0.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .tp-stop:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(28,61,42,0.09);
    }
    .tp-stop__icon {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: block;
    }
    .tp-stop h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .tp-stop p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* ===== SEASONS GRID ===== */
    .tp-seasons {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .tp-season {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(28,61,42,0.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .tp-season__label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--amber-dark);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: block;
    }
    .tp-season h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .tp-season p {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* ===== CABIN PICKS ===== */
    .tp-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .tp-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid rgba(28,61,42,0.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .tp-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(28,61,42,0.09);
    }
    .tp-card__season {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--pine);
      background: rgba(28,61,42,0.06);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .tp-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .tp-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .tp-card__link {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--amber-dark);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .tp-card__link:hover { color: var(--amber); }

    /* ===== CTA STRIP ===== */
    .tp-cta {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 56px 0 64px;
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .tp-cta h2 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .tp-cta p {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .btn--primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--pine);
      color: var(--cream);
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn--primary:hover { background: var(--pine-light); }

    /* ===== MOBILE ===== */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .tp-hero__content { padding-bottom: 40px; }
      .tp-hero__content h1 { font-size: 26px; }
      .tp-hero__sub { font-size: 15px; }
      .tp-gate { padding: 28px 20px; }
      .tp-section { padding: 36px 0; }
      .tp-stops { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .tp-seasons { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .tp-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 400px) {
      .tp-seasons { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('../partials/guide-nav') %>

<header class="tp-hero">
  <img class="tp-hero__img" src="https://pub-629428d185ca4960a0a73c850d32294b.r2.dev/generated-images/company_197924/1da12ea6-9762-4418-aec4-f0db946b2776.jpg" alt="Buffalo River at sunrise with limestone bluffs">
  <div class="tp-hero__overlay"></div>
  <div class="tp-hero__content">
    <span class="tp-hero__badge">Free Download</span>
    <h1>Your Ozarks Trip Planner</h1>
    <p class="tp-hero__sub">Top 5 stops, best times to visit, and cabin picks by season — all in one place. Enter your email to unlock the guide.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="tp-body">

  <% if (!emailSubmitted) { %>
  <!-- EMAIL GATE -->
  <section class="tp-section" style="padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px;">
    <div class="tp-gate">
      <h2 class="tp-gate__title">Get the Free Ozarks Trip Planner</h2>
      <p class="tp-gate__sub">We'll send you the full guide with top stops, seasonal tips, and our best cabin picks — right to your inbox.</p>
      <form class="tp-gate__form" method="POST" action="/guides/trip-planner">
        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
          <div class="tp-gate__error"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>
        <input
          class="tp-gate__input"
          type="email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="your@email.com"
          value="<%= typeof values !== 'undefined' && values.email ? values.email : '' %>"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
        >
        <button type="submit" class="btn--amber">Get the Guide</button>
      </form>
      <p class="tp-gate__fine">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <% } %>

  <% if (emailSubmitted) { %>
  <!-- PLANNER CONTENT (revealed after email submit) -->
  <section class="tp-section" style="padding-top: 56px;">
    <h2>Top 5 Ozarks Stops</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Five places that define what the Ozarks is really about — and why people keep coming back.</p>
    <div class="tp-stops">
      <div class="tp-stop">
        <span class="tp-stop__icon">🌊</span>
        <h3>Bull Shoals Lake</h3>
        <p>Crystal-clear water, dramatic limestone bluffs, and some of the best fishing in the state. Less crowded than Beaver Lake, with excellent boating and kayaking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-stop">
        <span class="tp-stop__icon">🏞️</span>
        <h3>Buffalo River</h3>
        <p>America's first national river — undammed, wild, and 153 miles of free-flowing water. Towering bluffs, elk herds in fall, and no shortage of swimming holes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-stop">
        <span class="tp-stop__icon">🕳️</span>
        <h3>Blanchard Springs Caverns</h3>
        <p>An underground world two miles north of Mountain View. Constant 58°F year-round, with Dripstone and Discovery trails through rooms of active formations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-stop">
        <span class="tp-stop__icon">🏰</span>
        <h3>Eureka Springs</h3>
        <p>A Victorian hill town built into steep hillsides, with underground streets, artisan shops, and a concentration of art galleries that defies its size.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-stop">
        <span class="tp-stop__icon">🛤️</span>
        <h3>Jasper & Highway 7</h3>
        <p>One of the most scenic drives in Arkansas — the small town of Jasper has grown into the area's base camp for outdoor recreation, with the Arkansas Grand Canyon overlook nearby.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tp-section">
    <h2>Best Time to Visit</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Each season in the Ozarks has its own character. Here's what to expect.</p>
    <div class="tp-seasons">
      <div class="tp-season">
        <span class="tp-season__label">March – May</span>
        <h3>Spring</h3>
        <p>Wildflowers bloom along the Buffalo River, temperatures warm into the 60s–70s. Prime time for hiking before summer crowds arrive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-season">
        <span class="tp-season__label">June – August</span>
        <h3>Summer</h3>
        <p>River season at its best — swimming, kayaking, floating. Warm days (80s–90s), cool spring water. Book cabins early for July.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-season">
        <span class="tp-season__label">September – November</span>
        <h3>Fall</h3>
        <p>Cooler temperatures and changing leaves. Elk viewing peaks October–December. Best time for scenic drives on Highway 7 and 21.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-season">
        <span class="tp-season__label">December – February</span>
        <h3>Winter</h3>
        <p>Quiet, few crowds, low cabin rates. Cave tours at Blanchard Springs are 58°F year-round. Some operators offer deep off-season discounts.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tp-section">
    <h2>Cabin Picks by Season</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">The right cabin makes the trip. These are the types that shine in each season.</p>
    <div class="tp-cards">
      <div class="tp-card">
        <span class="tp-card__season">Spring</span>
        <h3>Riverfront Cabin near Ponca</h3>
        <p>Spring wildflowers on the bank, easy access to Buffalo River put-ins. Perfect base for hiking Hemmed-In Hollow.</p>
        <a href="/listings?filter=riverfront" class="tp-card__link">Find riverfront cabins &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-card">
        <span class="tp-card__season">Summer</span>
        <h3>Lakeview Cabin with Boat Dock</h3>
        <p>Bull Shoals Lake is at its best in summer — jump in from your own dock, kayaks included with many properties.</p>
        <a href="/listings?filter=lake" class="tp-card__link">Find lake cabins &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-card">
        <span class="tp-card__season">Fall</span>
        <h3>Secluded Forest Cabin</h3>
        <p>Elk herds, fall colors, and cool nights by the fire. The Ozarks in autumn is something else — worth seeking out.</p>
        <a href="/listings?filter=secluded" class="tp-card__link">Find secluded cabins &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-card">
        <span class="tp-card__season">Winter</span>
        <h3>Hot Tub Cabin near Eureka Springs</h3>
        <p>Off-season rates, warm soaks, Victorian charm in town. Blanchard Springs Caverns is 20 minutes away, rain or shine.</p>
        <a href="/listings?filter=hot-tub" class="tp-card__link">Find hot tub cabins &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tp-cta">
    <h2>Ready to book your Ozarks stay?</h2>
    <p>Browse curated cabin, camping, and RV rentals — sourced from Vrbo, Booking.com, and direct owners.</p>
    <a href="/listings" class="btn--primary">Browse Ozarks Cabins</a>
  </section>
  <% } %>

</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
<script>(function(){var slug="ozarkroost";if(!slug)return;var vid=localStorage.getItem('polsia_vid');if(!vid){vid='xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g,function(c){var r=Math.random()*16|0;return(c==='x'?r:(r&0x3|0x8)).toString(16);});localStorage.setItem('polsia_vid',vid);}new Image().src='https://polsia.com/api/beacon/pixel?s='+encodeURIComponent(slug)+'&v='+encodeURIComponent(vid);})();</script>
</body>
</html>